### Performance requirements

Prefer:
- AVIF.
- WebP.
- Optimised JPEG fallback.

Hero:
- loading="eager".
- fetchPriority="high".
- Preload only the hero image.

Below the fold:
- loading="lazy".
- decoding="async".

Gallery:
- Optimised thumbnails first.
- Load full-resolution images only when opened.

Additional requirements:
- Use srcset and sizes.
- Specify image dimensions.
- Avoid layout shifts.
- Do not load the entire gallery immediately.
- Avoid huge base64 images.
- Prefer locally optimised assets in public/images/.
- Do not invent filenames or image URLs.
- Do not rely on unreliable external image hotlinking.

If genuine business assets cannot be retrieved, identify the missing assets and use clearly representative photography.

